{
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Hundreds of array problems are solved with fewer than ten techniques. The skill interviewers are really testing is **recognition**: reading a problem and thinking \"this smells like a sliding window\". This lesson is your map; under each technique are the interview questions in this course that use it."
    },
